{"seq":3,"slug":"governance-metrics-and-readiness","title":"治理度量与准备度：能力评估、合规指标与协调有效性测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-governance-international-coordination/enforcement-and-metrics/governance-metrics-and-readiness","wordCount":3097,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"治理度量与准备度-能力评估-合规指标与协调有效性测量\">治理度量与准备度：能力评估、合规指标与协调有效性测量</h1><p>治理机制铺开之后，最难回答的问题不是「规则写了什么」，而是「这套东西到底有没有用」。立法者想知道义务有没有被遵守，实验室想知道红线设得对不对，跨境团队想知道距离下一个生效时点还差多少文件。这三类问题指向三种不同的测量对象——<strong>模型的能力</strong>、<strong>组织的合规状态</strong>、<strong>国际机制的协调有效性</strong>——混淆它们，就会用跑分去证明合规、用文件数量去证明安全。本文把三层测量拆开，再合成一个可逐季度复算的<strong>准备度评分</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-治理度量是三个不能混的层次\">核心概念：治理度量是三个不能混的层次</h2><p>度量的第一步是分清「测谁」。<strong>能力度量</strong>的对象是被治理的模型本身：它能做哪些危险的事、越过哪条能力阈值。<strong>合规度量</strong>的对象是治理动作：组织有没有按规定留证据、按时上报事件、完成影响评估。<strong>协调有效性度量</strong>的对象是国际机制：一份承诺有多少辖区兑现、一张证书在多少地方被接受。三者的指标性质完全不同——能力度量测「风险有多大」，合规度量测「义务履行到什么程度」，协调度量测「共同规则是否真的收敛」。</p>\n<p>除了三层还有<strong>准备度</strong>（readiness），它不是独立测量对象，而是前三层的<strong>加权合成</strong>——回答「面对未来某个生效时点，我现在的提前量有多少」，把静态义务清单变成可复算、可按法域拆缺口的进度条。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;治理度量总框架&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;能力度量&lt;br/&gt;模型能做什么&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;合规度量&lt;br/&gt;义务履行到什么程度&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;协调度量&lt;br/&gt;共同规则是否收敛&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;红线测试 / 基准 / 第三方评测&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;控制项符合性 / 事件上报 / 影响评估&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;承诺兑现率 / 证书互认覆盖率 / 生效时延&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;准备度评分&lt;br/&gt;加权合成三项&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;缺口识别&lt;br/&gt;按法域 / 按义务拆开&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"治理度量总框架\"] --&gt; B[\"能力度量&lt;br/&gt;模型能做什么\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"合规度量&lt;br/&gt;义务履行到什么程度\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"协调度量&lt;br/&gt;共同规则是否收敛\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"红线测试 / 基准 / 第三方评测\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"控制项符合性 / 事件上报 / 影响评估\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"承诺兑现率 / 证书互认覆盖率 / 生效时延\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"准备度评分&lt;br/&gt;加权合成三项\"]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[\"缺口识别&lt;br/&gt;按法域 / 按义务拆开\"]</pre><p>判断一个治理指标是否有用，只问一件事：<strong>它的证据能否被独立复核</strong>。自评的分数、无法追溯来源的百分比、由被约束者单独定义的阈值，都不构成度量，只是表态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能力度量-测的是工具-不是真实能力\">能力度量：测的是工具，不是真实能力</h2><p>能力评估有一个被低估的性质——它测量的是<strong>测量工具本身</strong>，而非模型的真实能力上限。同一模型换一组提示词或换一种能力诱导方式（capability elicitation），结论可以相差很大。这个偏差可写成一个量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>observed</mtext></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>true</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>η</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 且通常随能力上升而下降</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{C_{\\text{observed}}}{C_{\\text{true}}}, \\qquad \\eta &lt; 1 \\text{ 且通常随能力上升而下降}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">true</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">observed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且通常随能力上升而下降</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是测量有效性。早期模型的危险能力容易被基准捕捉，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1；越前沿的模型越可能「知道自己在被测试」或隐藏能力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 反而下降——这是能力度量层的结构性难题。</p>\n<p>当前的能力度量靠三条并行证据线：<strong>开发者自评</strong>（基准 + 内部红队）、<strong>第三方独立评测</strong>（英国 AI Security Institute 的开源平台 Inspect，美国 NIST 下属 CAISI 的网络与生物安全类非涉密评估）、以及<strong>监管方准入评估</strong>（欧盟 AI Office 的模型访问权）。2025 年 7 月，国际 AI 安全研究所网络成员联合开展 AI 智能体评测演练，覆盖敏感信息泄露与网络安全风险（来源：aisi.gov.uk/work；nist.gov/caisi）。</p>\n<p>能力度量落成指标时，可用的量有四类，全部要求留下可复核记录：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标类别</th>\n<th>具体量</th>\n<th>证据源</th>\n<th>复核方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阈值触发</td>\n<td>训练算力是否越过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>25</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{25}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>26</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{26}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">26</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> FLOP</td>\n<td>算力台账、模型卡</td>\n<td>独立机构交叉估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危险能力覆盖</td>\n<td>被测危险类别 / 应测类别</td>\n<td>评测报告的方法学章节</td>\n<td>方法是否公开可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防护有效性</td>\n<td>越狱成功率、红队发现严重等级分布</td>\n<td>对抗性测试日志</td>\n<td>第三方重跑抽样用例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测量有效性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计区间（跨提示集合的离散度）</td>\n<td>多组提示下的结论差异</td>\n<td>换诱导方式重测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对纳入产品链的团队，能力度量只需落到一个动作：<strong>在供应商准入清单里记录「模型由谁评测、测了哪些危险类别、结论是否可复现」</strong>。把自评当独立证据是最常见的技术性错误（评测机构分工详见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../frontier-model-regulation/model-evaluation-gatekeeping\">模型评估与准入把关</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规度量-把义务翻译成可观测的指标\">合规度量：把义务翻译成可观测的指标</h2><p>合规度量的起点不是「建立指标体系」，而是<strong>从义务反推</strong>：每条义务要留下什么证据、能多快被核对。翻错的典型是把「有政策」当作合规的证明——那是结构性指标，几乎不消耗真实控制力。NIST AI RMF 的 MEASURE 功能给出的纪律是：指标必须绑定可重复的测试与可追溯的记录，而非一次性的文档签署。</p>\n<p>合规指标可按三个层次设计，强度递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>指标形态</th>\n<th>例</th>\n<th>弱点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构性</td>\n<td>有无某份文件或某个角色</td>\n<td>是否设 AI 负责人、是否有 AI 政策</td>\n<td>一签了事，不反映运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过程性</td>\n<td>某动作的执行频率与覆盖</td>\n<td>影响评估覆盖率、红队执行频次</td>\n<td>可被形式上完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果性</td>\n<td>真实发生的事件与处置</td>\n<td>严重事件数、上报时延、整改闭环率</td>\n<td>需要真实的报告通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最有说服力的是<strong>结果性指标</strong>，因为它绑定到监管者最终会追问的东西。欧盟 AI 法案第 55(1)(c) 条要求系统性风险模型的提供者在不无故迟延的情况下上报严重事件与纠正措施；加州 SB 53 把它写成可计时的硬指标——符合条件的安全事件须在 <strong>15 天内</strong>向州应急服务办公室报告，「灾难性风险」的门槛是致 <strong>50 人以上</strong>死亡或重伤、或造成 <strong>10 亿美元以上</strong>经济损失（来源：artificialintelligenceact.eu；加州 SB 53，2025-09-25 签署）。事件数本身不是坏消息，<strong>上报时延与整改闭环率</strong>才是成熟度指标——从不报告事件的组织，通常不是没有事件，而是没有可用的报告通道。</p>\n<p>合规度量必须与可认证的流程体系对接，否则指标会脱离审计接口。ISO/IEC 42001:2023 是首个可第三方认证的 AI 管理体系要求型标准，其符合性陈述（statement of applicability）列明哪些控制项被纳入、哪些被排除——这份清单直接决定度量覆盖多少义务。把指标挂在 42001 的控制项上，多重合规便可用一套证据承载：向欧盟、日本、韩国供货的团队，多数流程性指标只需采集一次（标准链条见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../international-coordination/standards-interoperability\">技术标准互操作</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协调有效性度量-判断国际机制是否真的在起作用\">协调有效性度量：判断国际机制是否真的在起作用</h2><p>国际机制的产出多是声明与报告，容易被误读为「没有度量」。事实上协调有效性有可测量的维度，只是测的不是「有没有管住某个模型」，而是「共同规则是否在收敛」。四个维度可并置观察：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>度量问题</th>\n<th>观测口径</th>\n<th>当前的典型读数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖面</td>\n<td>多少辖区/实验室进入同一框架</td>\n<td>签署方数、批准方数</td>\n<td>欧洲委员会框架公约 50+ 国背书，生效需第五份批准书</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑现率</td>\n<td>承诺转化为国内法/内部框架的比例</td>\n<td>承诺项 → 落地条款数</td>\n<td>峰会承诺多为自愿，兑现依赖国内立法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时延</td>\n<td>从承诺到生效相隔多久</td>\n<td>开放签署 → 生效日期差</td>\n<td>框架公约模式下拉长至数年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互认度</td>\n<td>一张证书在多少辖区被直接接受</td>\n<td>认可互认覆盖的辖区比例</td>\n<td>依赖 IAF/ILAC 多边互认，而非政府间协定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这四个维度合起来，能解释一个反复出现的现象：<strong>峰会序列的参与面每扩大一次，共同文本的约束力就向最小公约数收缩</strong>。2023 年 Bletchley 的 28 国 + 欧盟产出议题共识，2025 年巴黎 58 国签署时美英拒签，2026 年新德里 100 多个国家代表团参加却未产生具约束力宣言。这不是协调失败，而是覆盖面与约束力之间的结构性权衡。</p>\n<p>协调度量对企业的用途是判断<strong>该把哪一层当约束来准备</strong>。联合国机制（A/RES/79/325 设立的科学小组与全球治理对话）产出证据与合法性，不是义务；条约路径（欧洲委员会框架公约）写入可援引的条约语言，但生效慢；区域立法（欧盟 AI 法案）才是已生效的硬约束。判据是把某条「国际规则」归类为<strong>已生效义务 / 可援引条约语言 / 自愿承诺 / 仅具议程意义的表态</strong>，四者的合规投入差一个数量级（主体权责见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../landscape-and-actors/actor-map-and-mandates\">治理主体图谱</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准备度评估-把三层度量合成一条进度条\">准备度评估：把三层度量合成一条进度条</h2><p>准备度不是新指标，而是三层度量的加权合成。设能力覆盖度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、合规完备度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>、协调接口接入度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，均归一化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>ready</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{ready}} = w_c \\, C + w_g \\, G + w_i \\, I, \\qquad w_c + w_g + w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ready</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个分量必须写清楚含义，否则权重会变成拍脑袋的数字。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是「被测危险类别占应测类别的比例」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是「已具备证据的义务项占目标法域义务总数的比例」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是「已接入的承认/报告接口占所需接口的比例」。权重反映战略重心：以多辖区准入为主的团队抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，以自研基座为主的团队抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。缺口是目标与现状之差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>ready</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = S_{\\text{target}} - S_{\\text{ready}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ready</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 按法域和按义务拆开，就是一份可排序的行动清单——比笼统的「合规待办」有用，因为它能回答「先补哪一块，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 下降最快」。准备度的时间轴由各法域生效时点锚定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域/机制</th>\n<th>关键时点</th>\n<th>到期义务</th>\n<th>准备度关注的分量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欧盟 AI 法案</td>\n<td>2024-08-01 生效；2025-08-02 GPAI；2026-08-02 其余；2027-12-02 附件 III；2028-08-02 附件 I</td>\n<td>分级义务与合格评定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加州 SB 53</td>\n<td>2025-09-25 签署</td>\n<td>安全框架公开、15 天事件上报</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧洲委员会框架公约</td>\n<td>第五份批准书交存三个月后生效</td>\n<td>人权影响评估等条约义务</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>复算节奏要与义务性质匹配：结果性指标按月，过程性指标按季度，能力与协调指标按半年。频率错配会两头出问题——月报追半年才变的分量只会制造虚假波动，年报追事件上报则会错过时延要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>治理度量做对的关键，是<strong>先分清测的是谁，再决定用什么证据</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分辨测量层次</strong>：能力度量测模型、合规度量测义务履行、协调度量测共同规则收敛。用跑分证明合规、用文件数量证明安全，都是层次错配。</li>\n<li><strong>能力度量有天花板</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>observed</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>true</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = C_{\\text{observed}} / C_{\\text{true}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">observed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">true</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常小于 1 且随能力上升而下降；评测可信度依赖多方独立复核，自评不能当独立证据。</li>\n<li><strong>合规指标要落到结果性一层</strong>：结构性、过程性指标易被形式化完成，事件数、上报时延、整改闭环率才是监管者追问的量。SB 53 的 15 天时限与「50 人死亡/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 亿美元」门槛是可计时的硬指标样例。</li>\n<li><strong>协调有效性看四维</strong>：覆盖面、兑现率、时延、互认度；只看参与规模会得出相反结论——参与面越广，共同文本的约束力越向最小公约数收缩。</li>\n<li><strong>准备度是可复算的进度条</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>ready</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{ready}} = w_c C + w_g G + w_i I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ready</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，缺口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 按法域拆开排序，比笼统的合规待办更能指导行动。</li>\n<li><strong>可复核性是底线</strong>：任何无法被独立复核的分数、百分比或阈值定义，都不构成度量，只是表态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"治理度量与准备度：能力评估、合规指标与协调有效性测量","id":"治理度量与准备度-能力评估-合规指标与协调有效性测量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：治理度量是三个不能混的层次","id":"核心概念-治理度量是三个不能混的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"能力度量：测的是工具，不是真实能力","id":"能力度量-测的是工具-不是真实能力"},{"level":2,"text":"合规度量：把义务翻译成可观测的指标","id":"合规度量-把义务翻译成可观测的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"协调有效性度量：判断国际机制是否真的在起作用","id":"协调有效性度量-判断国际机制是否真的在起作用"},{"level":2,"text":"准备度评估：把三层度量合成一条进度条","id":"准备度评估-把三层度量合成一条进度条"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"执法协同与制裁：罚则梯度、市场准入与出口执法联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-governance-international-coordination/enforcement-and-metrics/enforcement-and-sanctions"},"next":null}